*.mermaid.md text eol=lf

# The fold record is append-only and written by /scope's consolidation
# judgment, so two branches each recording a fold would otherwise conflict on
# every concurrent chain. Union merge keeps both rows.
#
# Union cannot deduplicate, so a cross-branch duplicate row is possible. Rows
# are keyed by the pre-fold blob hash, which makes a duplicate a duplicate of an
# identical fact rather than a contradiction, and the record checker flags it.
docs/folds.md merge=union
